# Shivering Isles. SE04Shell "Understanding Madness" (up to the two Dukes' quests) and SE04 "Addiction" (Thadon, Duke of
# Mania: the Chalice of Reversal). SE03A 200 set SE04Shell 5 and the player stands in Sheogorath's palace
# (cell SENSCastleSheogorath) after leaving Xedilian.
#
# Path taken: Sheogorath's tutorial and intro speech, then SE04 through WIDE-EYE (SE04 20, SEWideEye in Thadon's House of
# Mania). The other source of the Chalice's whereabouts, Kithlan in the House of Dementia (SE04 30), is not drafted, nor is
# Haskill's own advice. Inside the Burrow the player is not made to find Felldew again: the first dose (Felldew from the
# special Elytra outside) is taken at the door and each cell is entered by its door (a moveto to the far side of the loading
# door stands in for the walk), so the withdrawal stages (SE04 45 at about 90 s of game time) may be reached on the way.
#
# SE04Shell: 5 (SE03A) -> Sheogorath "I was attacked by Knights..." -> "Xedilian functions once more." (INFO 00044F52:
# SEHaskillREF.tutorialVAR 1, spell SElpSummonHaskill, stage 3) -> the player summons Haskill twice (his lines and Sheogorath's
# advance tutorialVAR 2, 3, 4) -> the intro speech (SheoIntroVAR 2) -> "Learn? Learn what?" (INFO 00044F54: SE04 5, SE05 10,
# SE04Shell 10). SE04Shell 10's result chain (SE04 0 -> SE03A 200 -> SE04Shell 5) is the authors' own; the case waits on
# GetStageDone, not GetStage. SE04Shell 20 and 30 (journal lines for "finished Thadon's / Syl's task") are set by nothing.
# SE04Shell 200 (SE04ShellScript: SE04 200 and SE05 200, sets SE06 5, stops SE04 and SE05) WAITS FOR SE05, as does 210 (set by
# SE06 6): not here. SE04 100 is set by nothing; 200 is the end.
# DRAFT 2026-11-17: not run yet.

# Sheogorath's greeting at SE04Shell 5 with SE04.SheoTalk 0: "Well now, what news do you have to report?" (INFO 00044F51)
# offers "I was attacked by Knights..." (INFO 00082489) -> "Xedilian functions once more." (INFO 00044F52, a goodbye; its
# result runs after the last line: tutorialVAR 1, the spell, stage 3). The travel from Xedilian is the player's: moveto.
case se04shell_xedilian
run
player.moveto SESheogorathREF
wait 120
approach SESheogorathREF
talk SESheogorathREF
ask "I was attacked by Knights..."
ask "Xedilian functions once more."
until 300 SEHaskillREF.tutorialVAR == 1
until 300 GetStageDone SE04Shell 3 == 1
bye if open
end

# Summoning Haskill: SESummonHaskillSpellSCRIPT (the lesser power SElpSummonHaskill, only in the Isles) moves him to the
# player and force-greets (SEHaskillSummonForcegreet). With tutorialVAR 1 his line is "Ah... our Lord has granted you the
# power to summon me." (INFO 00081B7E, goodbye, tutorialVAR 2, needs summoned != 0). He leaves 5 s after the summon plus a
# fade (summoned back to 0), and a second summon before that only says "summoned too recently". Sheogorath's next greeting
# with tutorialVAR 2 is "Isn't that a hoot?" (INFO 00081B69, goodbye, tutorialVAR 3); the second summon (tutorialVAR 3)
# says "Ah, summoned again." (INFO 00081B7D, goodbye, tutorialVAR 4). Casting the power by console stands in for the player
# choosing it. All in one case: no boundary between a summon and its force-greet.
case se04shell_summon
run
player.cast SElpSummonHaskill player
hear 1800 SEHaskillREF granted you the power
until 300 SEHaskillREF.tutorialVAR == 2
bye if open
until 1800 SEHaskillREF.summoned == 0
approach SESheogorathREF
talk SESheogorathREF
until 300 SEHaskillREF.tutorialVAR == 3
bye if open
run
player.cast SElpSummonHaskill player
hear 1800 SEHaskillREF summoned again
until 300 SEHaskillREF.tutorialVAR == 4
bye if open
until 1800 SEHaskillREF.summoned == 0
end

# With tutorialVAR 4 Sheogorath's greeting is "Good, good! You'll need all the help you can get ..." (INFO 00081B68), which
# offers "Jyggalag? Who is that?" and "What is the Greymarch?". "What would You ask of me now?" (INFO 00044F53) is gated on
# SE04Shell.SheoIntroVAR == 2 (GetQuestVariable, index 1), and only "Me? How?" (INFO 0008245F) and "What is the Greymarch?"
# (INFO 00082460) add 1 each: "Me?" is offered only by "Jyggalag? Who is that?" (INFO 0008245E). So: Jyggalag -> "Me? How?"
# (1) -> "What is the Greymarch?" (2) -> "What would You ask of me now?" -> "Learn? Learn what?" (INFO 00044F54: SE04 5,
# SE05 10, SheoTalk 1, SE04Shell 10).
case se04shell_intro
approach SESheogorathREF
talk SESheogorathREF
ask "Jyggalag? Who is that?"
ask "Me? How?"
ask "What is the Greymarch?"
ask "What would You ask of me now?"
ask "Learn? Learn what?"
until 300 GetStageDone SE04Shell 10 == 1
until 300 GetStage SE04 >= 5
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 10
bye if open
end

# Thadon in the House of Mania (SE04 5). His greeting "Ahh yes, THERE you are!" (INFO 000131D3, only GetIsID SEThadon at
# this stage) offers four answers; each of the first three and "You... don't care?" adds the topic "Chalice of Reversal"
# (INFO 000131D8 for "You've been waiting forever."). The topic (INFO 000131D9) offers "Yes, I have." (INFO 0001330A) ->
# "Who?" (INFO 0001330B) -> "What happened?" (INFO 00019524, a goodbye) whose result sets SE04.Stage10Update 1; SEThadonScript
# (GameMode) sets SE04 10, which enables SE04ElytraStartingRef. ("You mean Syl!" needs SE05 200: not offered.)
case se04_thadon
run
player.moveto SEThadonRef
wait 120
approach SEThadonRef
talk SEThadonRef
ask "You've been waiting forever."
ask "Chalice of Reversal"
ask "Yes, I have."
ask "Who?"
ask "What happened?"
until 600 SE04.Stage10Update == 1
until 600 GetStage SE04 >= 10
bye if open
end

# Wide-Eye (SEWideEyeREF, same house). At SE04 10 his greeting is "You've been speaking to Thadon." (INFO 0001E3FF, say
# once) or "Yes? How may I assist you?" (INFO 0001E400). "Chalice of Reversal" (INFO 00013385, SE04 10 .. 49, 20 not done,
# say once) adds "Felldew" and "Dunroot Burrow"; "Dunroot Burrow" (INFO 0001338B, same gates) sets 20 (ShowMap
# XPDunrootBurrowMapMarker).
case se04_wideeye
run
player.moveto SEWideEyeREF
wait 120
approach SEWideEyeREF
talk SEWideEyeREF
ask "Chalice of Reversal"
ask "Dunroot Burrow"
until 300 GetStage SE04 >= 20
bye if open
end

# Felldew: SE04ElytraStartingRef (SE04FelldewElytraSPECIAL, "Elytra Hatchling", aggression 100) stands outside the Burrow
# door and drops one SE04Felldew (SE04FelldewList, no chance of none). The player lands at the Dunroot Burrow map marker
# (200 away), fights it, and loots it (RemoveAllItems stands in for looting). Eating comes next case (its timers run).
case se04_elytra
run
player.moveto XPDunrootBurrowMapMarker
wait 60
defend
until 3600 SE04ElytraStartingRef.GetDead == 1
run
SE04ElytraStartingRef.RemoveAllItems player
until 300 player.GetItemCount SE04Felldew >= 1
end

# Eating Felldew (SE04FelldewScript, ScriptEffectStart) sets SE04 40 and SE04.FelldewState 1 (the Elytras go docile and
# SE04BarrierScript opens the membrane within 500 of SE04ExBarrierRef, 22815 50456, on the way to the door). `equipitem`
# stands in for eating. The player lands at SE04ElytraDoorGuardMark outside the membrane and walks the 500 to the door
# (SEDunrootBurrowExDoorRef), which takes him into Burrow 01. Each next cell is entered at its door (the far side of the
# loading door, as in mq05_sewer_plan): 01 -> 02 (00010D68) -> 03 (000169D1) -> 04 (0001695D) -> 05 (0001691E). Entering
# XPDunrootBurrow05 with SE04 40 .. 49 sets 50 (SE04QuestScript). Three Felldew addicts (ACHR 0008EF7F, 0008EF80, 0008EF82,
# "Chalice... Mine!") sit around the Chalice (SE04ChaliceRef, 000131C9); the player fights them (`defend`) and picks it up
# (`take`). SE04ChaliceScript sets 60 when the player holds it (result: unlocks DunrootDoor05toExteriorREF, SEObelisks 35).
case se04_burrow
run
player.moveto SE04ElytraDoorGuardMark
wait 60
run
player.equipitem SE04Felldew
until 300 GetStage SE04 >= 40
until 300 SE04.FelldewState == 1
run
player.moveto SEDunrootBurrowExDoorRef
wait 30
activate SEDunrootBurrowExDoorRef
until 900 player.GetInCell XPDunrootBurrow01 == 1
run
player.moveto 00010D68
wait 60
run
player.moveto 000169D1
wait 60
run
player.moveto 0001695D
wait 60
run
player.moveto 0001691E
wait 60
until 300 GetStage SE04 >= 50
defend
until 3600 0008EF7F.GetDead == 1
until 3600 0008EF80.GetDead == 1
until 3600 0008EF82.GetDead == 1
take 000131C9
until 300 GetStage SE04 >= 60
end

# SE04 60 unlocked the tower's door to the outside (DunrootDoor05toExteriorREF, 0001691D). The player takes it and goes back
# to Thadon (moveto stands in for the walk through New Sheoth). Thadon's greeting at SE04 60 is "The triumphant champion
# returns!" (INFO 00013452, a goodbye): its result takes the Chalice and sets 200 (SE04TrophyRef enabled, SEObelisks 40,
# SE04 stopped; SE06 5 only if SE05 is already 200, which is the other file's).
case se04_return
run
player.moveto 0001691D
wait 60
activate 0001691D
until 900 player.GetInCell XPDunrootBurrow05 == 0
run
player.moveto SEThadonRef
wait 120
approach SEThadonRef
talk SEThadonRef
until 300 GetStage SE04 >= 200
until 300 player.GetItemCount SE04Chalice == 0
bye if open
end
